        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the wireless services and equipment discussed above, our Business segment provides a variety of wireless and wireline services and products, which are organized by the primary customer groups for these offerings: Enterprise and Public Sector, Business Markets and Other, and Wholesale.",
        "start_character": 7199,
        "end_character": 7499
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Network access services – We sell network access to mobile virtual network operators (MVNOs) on a wholesale basis, who in turn resell wireless service under their own brand(s) to consumers.",
        "start_character": 6986,
        "end_character": 7175
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our Business segment provides wireless and wireline communications services and products, including mobility communication services, FWA and wireline broadband, Internet of Things (IoT) connectivity solutions, advanced communication services, corporate networking solutions, local and long distance voice services, and security and managed network services.",
        "start_character": 2038,
        "end_character": 2395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some states are also considering new network reliability or service quality requirements that may affect how and where we provide services if not preempted by federal law.",
        "start_character": 24103,
        "end_character": 24274
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also continue to expand our network coverage by partnering with satellite providers to enhance off-grid emergency and text messaging services.",
        "start_character": 13378,
        "end_character": 13523
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have relationships with high-profile national retailers that sell our wireless and wireline products and services, as well as convenience store chains that sell our wireless prepaid products and services.",
        "start_character": 10773,
        "end_character": 10985
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are licensed by the Federal Communications Commission (FCC) to provide these wireless services on the following low and mid-band spectrum in areas that collectively cover nearly all of the population of the U.S.: (i) the 700 MHz Upper C block, (ii) Cellular spectrum (850 MHz), (iii) Personal Communication Services (PCS) spectrum (1900 MHz), (iv) AWS 1 and AWS 3 bands (1700 MHz uplink and 2100 MHz downlink), and (v) the 3.7 GHz band (C-Band).",
        "start_character": 15150,
        "end_character": 15598
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to local, state, federal, and international laws and regulations relating to privacy and data protection that impact all parts of our business, including wireline, wireless, broadband and the development and roll out of new products.",
        "start_character": 26971,
        "end_character": 27219
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We design, build and operate networks to provide connectivity and related services meeting the needs of our diverse customers: consumers, businesses, government organizations, first responders and educational institutions.",
        "start_character": 11325,
        "end_character": 11547
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000732712-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000732712-26-000007-892d566da38b16c8",
        "accession_number": "0000732712-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect the market will continue to shift from traditional linear video to OTT offerings.",
